==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|celiac}} {{qualifier|US}}
* {{l|en|cœliac}} {{qualifier|Commonwealth, dated elsewhere}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|coeliacus}}, from {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|κοιλιακός}}, from {{m|grc|κοιλία||belly}}. Cognate with [[coelom]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsiːlɪæk/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

